  "scope": "Source V3000 numeric x/y/z into existing CJSON typed graph projection through Python and WASM. Eight synthetic development fixtures x three layouts. Not a holdout, toolkit-wide, speed, release, source-byte, query/polymer, implicit-hydrogen or stereochemical fidelity claim.",
  "compatibility": "New native/Python 3D coordinate API; legacy 2D shapes and stereo perception unchanged. Python explicit coords take precedence; coordinate writers keep their existing precision/metadata behavior.",
  "oracle": "Source-row atomic numbers, formal charges, simple indexed bonds, existing local isotope extension and coordinate decimal tokens are declared independently of toolkit output. Empty bond sections normalize to no bonds. No atom-order-independent isomorphism or stereo gate.",
